  "assembly_rail": "coordinates are read from NAMED assembly columns only. No coordinate is derived from or cross-checked against an element ID, and an absent hg38 coordinate is reported missing rather than filled from hg19.",
  "honest_limits": [
    "Schema figures come from a header read plus a bounded row sample, not a full parse, so per-cell absent-hg38 counts are SAMPLE rates and not cohort totals.",
    "The nulls assume UNIFORM element placement over a 3.1 Gbp genome. They are a reference for reading an observed rate, never a prediction about our corpus, which is cCRE/DNase/TSS-selected and non-uniform by construction.",
    "The chromosome-geography checks are TRUE BY CONSTRUCTION from the published split rule. They detect a broken parse and nothing else, and are blind to assembly and off-by-one error. They are labelled plumbing gates and are not evidence.",
    "This probe establishes FEASIBILITY and denominators only. It measures no overlap, and a pinned schema is not a validated join."
  ]
